      "text": "Suppliers of durable or nondurable consumer products are jointly liable for quality imperfections that make the product unfit or reduce its value. If the defect is not corrected within thirty (30) days, the consumer may choose one of the following remedies: replacement with a perfect product of the same kind, immediate reimbursement of the amount paid with monetary updating, or a proportionate price reduction. The parties may agree to adjust the remedy period, but it cannot be less than seven (7) nor more than one hundred and eighty (180) days.",
